p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids. February to March came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years. In 2025 that pair came in at 2% of normal, and January to February in 2025 at 12%. Every grid had its driest year in 2011, with grid 15112 down at 22% in 2011.</p>"}
